OL,3,GNEWSAPolice report reduced Bonfire
OL,4,ANight disorder despite 30 arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's chief constable has said
OL,7,Fsaid there was a reduction in disorder
OL,8,Fon this year's Bonfire Night, despite
OL,9,F30 arrests across the country.
OL,11,FIn a report on policing, Jo Farrell
OL,12,Fsaid there had been an increase in
OL,13,Freports between Halloween and Bonfire
OL,14,FNight, but serious incidents were down
OL,15,Fcompared to previous years.
OL,17,FPolice efforts to tackle disorder on
OL,18,FBonfire Night were called Operation
OL,19,FAmberlight, which the force's largest
OL,20,Fdeployment of officers since US
OL,21,FPresident Donald Trump's visit in July
OL,22,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
