OL,3,GNEWSAPolice report reduced Bonfire
OL,4,ANight disorder despite 30 arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven arrests were made on the night
OL,7,Fand further arrests are anticipated as
OL,8,Fpolice continue to investigate offences
OL,9,Fon 5 November.
